{"4873560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BRAYZ", "steam_appid": 4873560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extreme 8,000 km/h Racing with 64 Competitors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top speed: 8,000 km/h. This is a near-future racing game that pursues an overwhelming high-speed experience and the intense thrill of 64 machines competing at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer your rivals in the fastest race in human history!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4873560/extras/7bb58aaecc8e065f9acfcc0c49d911e0.poster.avif?t=1782280755\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4873560/extras/7bb58aaecc8e065f9acfcc0c49d911e0.webm?t=1782280755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4873560/extras/7bb58aaecc8e065f9acfcc0c49d911e0.mp4?t=1782280755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse Stages Racing Across a Futuristic Solar System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From futuristic metropolises lined with towering skyscrapers to orbital elevators stretching from the ocean into deep space, courses featuring a wide variety of situations await you across a futuristic solar system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4873560/extras/e8614a6a6a674ed4c7823dd82da681dd.poster.avif?t=1782280755\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4873560/extras/e8614a6a6a674ed4c7823dd82da681dd.webm?t=1782280755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4873560/extras/e8614a6a6a674ed4c7823dd82da681dd.mp4?t=1782280755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Strategy and Customization via Arts × Gear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy deep customization and strategic depth through various combinations of Arts and Gear. Find your own ultimate setup tailored to your machine and the course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4873560/extras/da649ada4a14426a1aa81a46a11e6b30.poster.avif?t=1782280755\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4873560/extras/da649ada4a14426a1aa81a46a11e6b30.webm?t=1782280755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4873560/extras/da649ada4a14426a1aa81a46a11e6b30.mp4?t=1782280755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Game Modes to Fit Your Playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career Mode: The main, immersive mode where you join tours, gradually earn prize money, and purchase parts to upgrade your machine step-by-step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Mode: All elements are unlocked from the start! A casual mode where you can enjoy high-speed races beyond the limits anytime with your favorite courses and machines.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extreme 8,000 km/h Racing with 64 Competitors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top speed: 8,000 km/h. This is a near-future racing game that pursues an overwhelming high-speed experience and the intense thrill of 64 machines competing at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer your rivals in the fastest race in human history!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loo